Package: forecastsuite
Title: Multi-Model Time Series Forecasting Toolkit and Local App
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Mukul", "Maheshwari", email = "gmcd9hyb6j@privaterelay.appleid.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Extends the Forecast Dashboard's Prophet/ARIMA workflow with a
    pluggable model registry (ARIMA, SARIMA, ETS, TBATS, NNETAR, Holt-Winters,
    and optional LSTM via torch) and a bundled local Shiny app exposing all
    models without the hosted app's memory-conserving constraints.
